    <title>Adversarial Robustness of Retrieval-Augmented Generation Pipelines</title>
    <summary>Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) pipelines are vulnerable to poisoning
      of the knowledge base. We quantify attack success rates for LLM agents.</summary>
